### Criar customer request JSM
POST https://your-domain.atlassian.net/rest/servicedeskapi/request
Authorization: Basic {{JIRA_BASIC_AUTH}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceDeskId": "1",
  "requestTypeId": "10001",
  "requestFieldValues": {
    "summary": "Erro ao registar fatura de venda",
    "description": "Mensagem de erro ao tentar registar documento...",
    "customfield_empresa_bc": "EMPRESA01",
    "customfield_ambiente_bc": "Production"
  }
}
